============================================================
FluidAudio
============================================================

This product uses FluidAudio (FluidInference, Apache-2.0) for local
speech recognition on Apple Neural Engine.

  * FluidAudio  https://github.com/FluidInference/FluidAudio

FluidAudio downloads CoreML model weights at runtime from
Hugging Face (FluidInference's published Parakeet TDT v3 and CTC
checkpoints). The model weights are not redistributed inside the
.app bundle and are governed by the upstream NVIDIA NeMo model
license terms posted at the corresponding Hugging Face repositories.
See THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md § "Model weights" for details.

